  "summary": "Explore the share of each regional district's population covered by vehicle-idling, open-burning, and solid-fuel-burning-appliance bylaws in 2016.",
  "sourceNote": "Environmental Reporting BC compiled bylaw status for municipalities and unincorporated areas in 2016, using 2015 population estimates. The map reuses the BC Data Mapper regional-district boundary, excluding Stikine because it has no row in the indicator table. Historical reporting names are matched to today's boundary names without changing the 2016 results.",
  "details": [
    "Click or tap a regional district to see the bylaw status reported for every municipality and unincorporated area in that district.",
    "Coverage is population-weighted, so a district with a bylaw in a large municipality may have a high coverage percentage even when other jurisdictions report none.",
    "The three scenes switch between vehicle-idling, open-burning, and solid-fuel-burning-appliance bylaws."
  ],
